# Walkthrough: Redesign Before → After

> [!IMPORTANT]
> Hanya perubahan **design**. Tidak ada perubahan fitur/logic.

---

## 0. Install Dependency Baru

```bash
npm install lucide-react
```

---

## 1. `globals.css` — CSS Variables

### 1A. Font Import (Line 1)

**Before:**
```css
@import url("https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap");
```

**After:**
```css
@import url("https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap");
@import url("https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Helvetica+Neue:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap");
```

### 1B. CSS Variables `:root` (Line 5–63)

**Before:**
```css
--bg-primary: #f0f2f5;
--bg-secondary: #ffffff;
--bg-card: #ffffff;
--bg-card-hover: #f7f8fa;
--bg-input: #ffffff;
--bg-overlay: rgba(10, 25, 47, 0.55);
--bg-navy: #0a1930;
--bg-navy-light: #122245;
```

**After:**
```css
--bg-primary: #0a0a0b;
--bg-secondary: #0c0c0e;
--bg-card: #131316;
--bg-card-hover: #151518;
--bg-input: #131316;
--bg-overlay: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
--bg-navy: #0c0c0e;
--bg-navy-light: #131316;
```

---

**Before:**
```css
--border-subtle: #e2e6ec;
--border-default: #cdd4de;
--border-focus: #1a5276;
```

**After:**
```css
--border-subtle: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.12);
--border-default: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.18);
--border-focus: #6366f1;
```

---

**Before:**
```css
--text-primary: #0a1930;
--text-secondary: #3d4f6f;
--text-tertiary: #7a8ba8;
--text-inverse: #ffffff;
--text-highlight: #c79b1a;
```

**After:**
```css
--text-primary: #e2e8f0;
--text-secondary: #94a3b8;
--text-tertiary: #64748b;
--text-inverse: #0a0a0b;
--text-highlight: #a78bfa;
```

---

**Before:**
```css
--accent-green: #1a8754;
--accent-green-hover: #157347;
--accent-green-light: rgba(26, 135, 84, 0.08);
```

**After:**
```css
--accent-green: #6366f1;
--accent-green-hover: #4f46e5;
--accent-green-light: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.1);
```

---

**Before:**
```css
--status-pending: #b8860b;
--status-pending-bg: rgba(184, 134, 11, 0.08);
--status-processing: #1a5276;
--status-processing-bg: rgba(26, 82, 118, 0.08);
--status-posted: #1a8754;
--status-posted-bg: rgba(26, 135, 84, 0.08);
--status-failed: #c0392b;
--status-failed-bg: rgba(192, 57, 43, 0.07);
--status-success: #1a8754;
--status-success-bg: rgba(26, 135, 84, 0.08);
--status-error: #c0392b;
--status-error-bg: rgba(192, 57, 43, 0.07);
```

**After:**
```css
--status-pending: #fbbf24;
--status-pending-bg: rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.1);
--status-processing: #818cf8;
--status-processing-bg: rgba(129, 140, 248, 0.1);
--status-posted: #34d399;
--status-posted-bg: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.1);
--status-failed: #fb7185;
--status-failed-bg: rgba(251, 113, 133, 0.1);
--status-success: #34d399;
--status-success-bg: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.1);
--status-error: #fb7185;
--status-error-bg: rgba(251, 113, 133, 0.1);
```

---

**Before:**
```css
--shadow-card: 0 1px 3px rgba(10, 25, 48, 0.06), 0 2px 8px rgba(10, 25, 48, 0.04);
--shadow-card-hover: 0 2px 6px rgba(10, 25, 48, 0.08), 0 4px 16px rgba(10, 25, 48, 0.06);
--shadow-modal: 0 8px 32px rgba(10, 25, 48, 0.18);
```

**After:**
```css
--shadow-card: 0 1px 3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
--shadow-card-hover: 0 4px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
--shadow-modal: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
```

### 1C. Tambah Custom Scrollbar (setelah body)

**Before:** _(tidak ada)_

**After:** Tambahkan setelah `body { ... }`:
```css
::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 6px; height: 6px; }
::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: transparent; }
::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: rgba(148,163,184,0.2); border-radius: 100px; }
::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: rgba(148,163,184,0.35); }
```

### 1D. Login Container (Line ~90)

**Before:**
```css
.login-container {
  background: var(--bg-navy);
}
```

**After:**
```css
.login-container {
  background: var(--bg-primary);
}
```

### 1E. Login Card (Line ~99)

**Before:**
```css
.login-card {
  background: var(--bg-card);
  border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-modal);
}
```

**After:**
```css
.login-card {
  background: var(--bg-card);
  border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-modal);
  border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
}
```

### 1F. Login Title (Line ~121)

**Before:**
```css
.login-title {
  color: var(--bg-navy);
}
```

**After:**
```css
.login-title {
  color: var(--text-primary);
}
```

### 1G. Auth Loading (Line ~347)

**Before:**
```css
.auth-loading {
  background: var(--bg-primary);
}
```

**After:**
```css
.auth-loading {
  background: var(--bg-primary);
}
```
_(otomatis berubah karena variable berubah)_

### 1H. App Header (Line ~363)

**Before:**
```css
.app-header {
  background: var(--bg-navy);
  border-radius: 0 0 var(--radius-lg) var(--radius-lg);
}
```

**After:**
```css
.app-header {
  background: var(--bg-primary);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  border-radius: 0;
}
```

