## 2. `page.tsx` — Layout Structure

### 2A. Import Section (Line 1–6)

**Before:**
```tsx
"use client";
import { useState, useEffect, useCallback, useRef } from "react";
import { useRouter } from "next/navigation";
import { getAuthClient } from "@/lib/supabase/auth-client";
```

**After:**
```tsx
"use client";
import { useState, useEffect, useCallback, useRef } from "react";
import { useRouter } from "next/navigation";
import { getAuthClient } from "@/lib/supabase/auth-client";
import {
  LayoutDashboard, CalendarDays, Activity, Settings,
  Bell, Search, Plus, Instagram, Edit2, Trash2,
  Image as ImageIcon, Video, CheckCircle2, XCircle,
  Clock, LogOut, ChevronDown
} from "lucide-react";
```

### 2B. Tambah Sidebar Component (sebelum `export default function Dashboard`)

**Before:** _(tidak ada sidebar)_

**After:** Tambahkan komponen Sidebar baru:
```tsx
function Sidebar() {
  return (
    <aside style={{
      position: "fixed", inset: "0", width: 256,
      background: "var(--bg-secondary)", borderRight: "1px solid var(--border-subtle)",
      display: "flex", flexDirection: "column", zIndex: 20
    }}>
      {/* Logo */}
      <div style={{ padding: "24px", display: "flex", alignItems: "center", gap: 12 }}>
        <div style={{
          width: 32, height: 32, borderRadius: 8,
          background: "linear-gradient(135deg, #6366f1, #7c3aed)",
          display: "flex", alignItems: "center", justifyContent: "center"
        }}>
          <Instagram style={{ width: 20, height: 20, color: "white" }} />
        </div>
        <span style={{ fontWeight: 700, color: "white", fontSize: 18 }}>AutoPost OS</span>
      </div>
      {/* Nav */}
      <nav style={{ padding: "0 16px", flex: 1 }}>
        <p style={{ fontSize: 10, textTransform: "uppercase", letterSpacing: "0.1em", color: "var(--text-tertiary)", marginBottom: 8, marginLeft: 8 }}>Core</p>
        <a href="#" style={{ display: "flex", alignItems: "center", gap: 12, padding: "8px 12px", background: "rgba(148,163,184,0.08)", color: "white", borderRadius: 8, textDecoration: "none", fontSize: 14 }}>
          <LayoutDashboard style={{ width: 16, height: 16 }} /> Dashboard
        </a>
        <a href="#" style={{ display: "flex", alignItems: "center", gap: 12, padding: "8px 12px", color: "var(--text-tertiary)", textDecoration: "none", fontSize: 14 }}>
          <CalendarDays style={{ width: 16, height: 16 }} /> Jadwal Posting
        </a>
        <a href="#" style={{ display: "flex", alignItems: "center", gap: 12, padding: "8px 12px", color: "var(--text-tertiary)", textDecoration: "none", fontSize: 14 }}>
          <Activity style={{ width: 16, height: 16 }} /> Log Aktivitas
        </a>
      </nav>
    </aside>
  );
}
```

### 2C. Main Dashboard Return — Root Container (Line ~708)

**Before:**
```tsx
<div className="app-container">
```

**After:**
```tsx
<div style={{ minHeight: "100vh", background: "var(--bg-primary)", color: "var(--text-secondary)", position: "relative" }}>
  {/* Background decoration */}
  <div style={{ position: "fixed", bottom: -192, right: -192, width: 384, height: 384, background: "rgba(99,102,241,0.1)", filter: "blur(120px)", borderRadius: "50%", pointerEvents: "none" }} />
  <Sidebar />
```

### 2D. Header Section (Line ~710–735)

**Before:**
```tsx
<header className="app-header">
  <div className="header-content">
    <div className="logo">
      <div>
        <h1>Sistem Otomatis Posting Instagram</h1>
        <span className="sapaan">Selamat Datang, {userEmail || "Pengguna"}!</span>
        <span>Platform Otomatis untuk Menjadwalkan...</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div className="header-actions">
      <div className="header-user"><IconUser /><span>{userEmail}</span></div>
      <div className="header-status"><span className="status-dot" />System Active</div>
      <button className="btn-logout" onClick={handleLogout}>Keluar</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>
```

**After:**
```tsx
<header style={{
  height: 64, marginLeft: 256, background: "rgba(10,10,11,0.8)",
  backdropFilter: "blur(12px)", borderBottom: "1px solid var(--border-subtle)",
  position: "sticky", top: 0, zIndex: 10,
  display: "flex", alignItems: "center", justifyContent: "space-between",
  padding: "0 32px"
}}>
  <div style={{ maxWidth: 400, width: "100%" }}>
    <div style={{ position: "relative", display: "flex", alignItems: "center" }}>
      <Search style={{ width: 16, height: 16, position: "absolute", left: 12, color: "var(--text-tertiary)" }} />
      <input type="text" placeholder="Search commands..."
        style={{ width: "100%", fontSize: 12, background: "rgba(148,163,184,0.06)", border: "1px solid var(--border-subtle)", borderRadius: 8, padding: "6px 12px 6px 36px", color: "var(--text-primary)", outline: "none" }}
      />
    </div>
  </div>
  <div style={{ display: "flex", alignItems: "center", gap: 16 }}>
    <button style={{ position: "relative", padding: 8, borderRadius: "50%", background: "transparent", border: "none", color: "var(--text-tertiary)", cursor: "pointer" }}>
      <Bell style={{ width: 20, height: 20 }} />
      <span style={{ position: "absolute", top: 4, right: 4, width: 10, height: 10, background: "#fb7185", borderRadius: "50%", border: "2px solid var(--bg-primary)" }} />
    </button>
    <div style={{ display: "flex", alignItems: "center", gap: 12, cursor: "pointer" }}>
      <div style={{ width: 32, height: 32, borderRadius: "50%", background: "linear-gradient(135deg, #818cf8, #34d399)", display: "flex", alignItems: "center", justifyContent: "center", color: "var(--bg-primary)", fontWeight: 700, fontSize: 12 }}>
        {(userEmail?.[0] || "A").toUpperCase()}
      </div>
      <div>
        <div style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 500, color: "var(--text-primary)", lineHeight: 1 }}>{userEmail || "user"}</div>
        <div style={{ fontSize: 11, color: "var(--text-tertiary)", marginTop: 2 }}>Admin</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>
```

### 2E. Main Content Area — Title + Actions (Line ~738–755)

**Before:**
```tsx
{/* Stats */}
<div className="stats-grid">
```

**After:** Bungkus stats + content dalam main dengan margin-left:
```tsx
<main style={{ marginLeft: 256, padding: "32px 32px", maxWidth: 1400 }}>
  <div style={{ marginBottom: 32, display: "flex", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end" }}>
    <div>
      <h1 style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 700, color: "white" }}>Platform Overview</h1>
      <p style={{ fontSize: 14, color: "var(--text-tertiary)", marginTop: 4 }}>
        Sistem Otomatis untuk Menjadwalkan dan Memposting Konten Instagram.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div style={{ display: "flex", gap: 12 }}>
      <button className="btn btn-secondary" onClick={handleLogout}>
        <LogOut style={{ width: 16, height: 16 }} /> Keluar
      </button>
      <button className="btn btn-primary" onClick={() => setShowCreateModal(true)}
        style={{ boxShadow: "0 0 12px rgba(79,70,229,0.3)" }}>
        <Plus style={{ width: 16, height: 16 }} /> Buat Jadwal
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div className="stats-grid">
```

### 2F. Status Badge Icons di Table Row (Line ~843–848)

**Before:**
```tsx
<span className={`status-badge ${s.status}`}>
  <span className="status-indicator" />
  {s.status}
</span>
```

**After:**
```tsx
<span className={`status-badge ${s.status}`}>
  {s.status === "posted" && <CheckCircle2 style={{ width: 14, height: 14 }} />}
  {s.status === "failed" && <XCircle style={{ width: 14, height: 14 }} />}
  {(s.status === "pending" || s.status === "processing") && <Clock style={{ width: 14, height: 14 }} />}
  {s.status}
</span>
```

### 2G. Media Badge di Table Row (Line ~826–830)

**Before:**
```tsx
<span className="media-badge">{s.media_type}</span>
```

**After:**
```tsx
<span className="media-badge" style={{ display: "inline-flex", alignItems: "center", gap: 6 }}>
  {s.media_type === "VIDEO" ? <Video style={{ width: 14, height: 14 }} /> : <ImageIcon style={{ width: 14, height: 14 }} />}
  {s.media_type}
</span>
```

### 2H. Action Buttons Icons (Line ~851–864)

**Before:**
```tsx
<button className="btn-icon edit" ...><IconEdit /></button>
<button className="btn-icon danger" ...><IconTrash /></button>
```

**After:**
```tsx
<button className="btn-icon edit" ...><Edit2 style={{ width: 16, height: 16 }} /></button>
<button className="btn-icon danger" ...><Trash2 style={{ width: 16, height: 16 }} /></button>
```

### 2I. Status Badge di Status Dot (globals.css `.status-badge`)

**Before:**
```css
.status-badge .status-indicator {
  width: 6px;
  height: 6px;
  border-radius: 50%;
}
```

**After:** Hapus `.status-indicator` styles (diganti icon di TSX), atau biarkan untuk backward compat.

---

## 3. `login/page.tsx` — Dark Login

Perubahan otomatis dari CSS variables. Tidak perlu ubah kode TSX. Cukup ubah di CSS:

### 3A. Login Button Color

**Before:**
```css
.login-btn {
  background: var(--accent-green);
}
.login-btn:hover {
  background: var(--accent-green-hover);
}
```

**After:** _(otomatis berubah karena `--accent-green` sekarang indigo)_

---

## 4. `forgot-password/page.tsx` & `reset-password/page.tsx`

Tidak perlu ubah kode TSX — semua perubahan visual otomatis dari CSS variables.

---

## 5. `layout.tsx` — Minimal Change

**Before:**
```tsx
<html lang="id">
  <body>{children}</body>
</html>
```

**After:** _(opsional, tambah class untuk font)_
```tsx
<html lang="id">
  <body style={{ fontFamily: '"Inter", "Helvetica Neue", sans-serif' }}>{children}</body>
</html>
```

---

## Ringkasan File yang Diubah

| File | Jenis Perubahan |
|------|----------------|
| `globals.css` | Ganti semua CSS variables ke dark theme + minor style updates |
| `page.tsx` | Tambah Sidebar, ubah Header, import lucide-react icons, ubah layout ke sidebar+main |
| `login/page.tsx` | Tidak perlu ubah (otomatis dari CSS) |
| `forgot-password/page.tsx` | Tidak perlu ubah (otomatis dari CSS) |
| `reset-password/page.tsx` | Tidak perlu ubah (otomatis dari CSS) |
| `layout.tsx` | Minor: font family |
